---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Accessibility — NEXAH" description="Accessibility information and contact route for nexah.de.">
  <article class="legal-page">
    <header class="container legal-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Public information</p><h1>Accessibility</h1><p class="lead">NEXAH aims to make its public material usable across devices, input methods and individual access needs.</p></header>
    <div class="container legal-content">
      <section><h2>Current support</h2><p>The website uses semantic structure, keyboard-accessible navigation, visible focus states, text alternatives for meaningful images and reduced-motion preferences. It is tested across desktop and mobile layouts.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Known limits</h2><p>Some historic publications, diagrams and source images may not yet have complete long-form alternatives. External publications and services retain their own accessibility responsibility.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Report a barrier</h2><p>If something prevents access, please describe the page, the barrier and the assistive technology used, if relevant. Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@nexah.de">contact@nexah.de</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Status</h2><p>This is a project accessibility statement and contact route. It is not a claim of formal conformity with a specific statutory standard.</p><p>Last reviewed: 24 July 2026.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
